<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudan drones are reported to have caused nearly three-quarters of war deaths this year, and South Sudan accuses Sudan of a drone strike that killed scores in a disputed area. A revenge attack killed 17 people and a Juba League activist was beaten to death by a mob linked to a local leader's murder. The government detained a pastor for a Christian song using musical instruments and a priest who had fled South Sudan was murdered in Birmingham. Elections have been postponed again to February 2027, and UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUzVVZlh0cUIxWFBYU2NGYnZWdHZmc1RLY3oyNm51NTlQQjJEMFlVclNsN2tWM0FjMmRycVdsMXQ2WW4xeUJZYVR1V3lac2ZBTmJ4RWcxYXVxaFlGV1dNbXM3OG5FOXhheVdiM0dzUVktZnJZZkQxNUU4ZWZuM0lWV2JyZXVKUXZtcDl2RHVaTVRtRGN1ZFdPckdPQ0dZSFI1SDVfVGlPbWhYa0o0alNCNFdsSDgtUkhxakRWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNMmJRZmNjYi1aWTVCOGc4VTZkUzVxR1k0bW5pUS1ZZGpFZEYtYmQ0Zm9SVmZ2ZFdna3RNRWhQRV9lNk1IaVRqb1JhdTdxbHRsTmdtWVpmdGZMSjFFMUtsWFRoZEZkU0F2b21ZZVRORms5dGl5NGdkaHo0VkN1a0QzU3ZCRHFQNHFHZFk4SnVmVE9XSTVFNkVkM3hHUTktYUJqUXBwaUV4MWotYXdU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOeEZQLWFzMHdkeG41bzdHdm9JRy12bEZHWmV0aG92VWJUQmtCQzdwQzZyaXUwc1lBQUphRVJJMmQzNUZ4WDNEeXR1ZExQenF3VmNMZk5YYm9rcmNjMWk5djF3UHNXd1RJUTFpYi1samJtT3dZNm5SbENSM1hjTHNvN09FRmhrZV9RenlGWE8yUHc3OWFJZjdEX3czcU9JcGJaQ3d4NE1OYmI3bG05b3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Morningstar News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQeUIwQ3YwYU80MXZ3cXJYRXBSckd3YUhZWFRXZi1NaVBQTkdtZmNENW90VVJyZlMwd0VNT0VKZU45alVZM25Pc3JFek5icXFiLVBBYmRuSmxLSjJldmMzbm9FeUhhX0UyUjJneF9FNm5HT0JVbFFRVDZGblhCUWd6am81WndvQlNvdGNoUHJHQU5YbmdBYkdHYk5